{"ts":"2026-07-12T08:08:23.019Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"Sentry PM-CLI-27 (first seen 2026-07-12T07:47Z): \"AbortError: Aborted with Ctrl+C\" captured at error level from a dogfood host. A deliberate user interrupt is expected control flow, not a defect — capturing it as an unresolved error-level event pollutes the feed AND can block the daily auto-release sentry-telemetry-gate (same blocking mechanic as the GH-521/pm-wfvq torn-install episode, but this one is guaranteed-benign and user-triggered).\n\nFix direction: classify user-initiated aborts (SIGINT, readline/prompt AbortError) as handled before the Sentry capture layer — either skip capture or downgrade to breadcrumb/info with a distinct handled tag. Do NOT add a generic message pattern to the release gate's environment patterns (pm-wfvq rule: real regressions can look identical); the classification must happen at capture time where intent is knowable.\n\nPM-CLI-27 itself resolved in Sentry as user-initiated after triage (this item owns the class fix)."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-ksv2"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Sentry captures deliberate Ctrl+C interrupts as error-level events (AbortError, PM-CLI-27)"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","sentry","telemetry"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-12T08:08:23.019Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-12T08:08:23.019Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":60},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"user-initiated SIGINT/Ctrl+C aborts are classified as handled non-error telemetry (breadcrumb or info event, or not captured at all); AbortError from readline/prompt cancellation no longer creates unresolved error-level Sentry issues; sentry-telemetry-gate cannot be blocked by a user pressing Ctrl+C; regression spec covers the abort path"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"04f4d5e6a5c09d6cae58830fe835f9d3c5d926f1617b6b4602a326d96fc64118","message":""}
